# PROVENANCE: Synthetic regression converted from the former unit test
# test_chained_immediate_write_survives_abort. A StandardData write is
# immediate even when it arrives as a two-frame chained command while a
# BackupData transaction is open, so AbortTransaction rolls back the backup file
# and keeps all 100 bytes of the standard file.
name: A chained StandardData write survives AbortTransaction
case-id: vecc-chained-immediate-write-survives-abort
